__pycache__/
*.pyc
.mise.local.toml

# Pre-close check receipts (vitalharmony/hrse#1208). Derived state; the tool
# is cross-repo, so the artifact lands here too. Without this rule the receipt
# shows as untracked, a `git add -A` commits it, and the tool's own dirty-tree
# guard then refuses on an artifact it created itself.
.claude/cache/
